\id RUT - Glefe Dialect Of Kwomtari 
\h Rute 
\toc3 Rut 
\toc2 Rute 
\toc1 Rutelu na 
\mt1 Rutelu na  
\iot Afwee guefu na  
\ip Eetegeni bukefu na nemboue lelee, yefeelu lufwalu lietume pulefoonelu buke. Rute Moapefu inali bofoo Israelefu lufwa bofoole falelee. Te weife Moapelu inengoi lamenei tetoo nunguli tafilalee. Te Rute nungulilu yefeele amee fanemelee te ifelamelee. Tetoo yefeekelu boe nalilu wokoo Judalu inengoile walalee, te Rute nifelee. Rute mei Israelelu Gotele reeyemee lefoolaleealee. Sabei Rute boe lufwa bofoole faleleeke, te Kin Devitelu naooefe lelee, nanoo nembouelu Israelelu kine.  
\ip Oone eetegeni nale fetafwalu, oonane ekeni inali Rutelu na menengule falemobe. Wolume Rute rawie inali, te nanookoe Israelelu Gotele ooretaleforime lelee, te yefeekelule mei eetutume lefoomelee. Rutelu nembouelu amee Gote Israelele na kaisekli faneteleeluleme nifemelee. Eetegeni na eese lelee, oone Gotele oonanoo menengoi nafiefoolamelu atukwe maretekume mei eetutume letelabu. Eetegeni bukefu na wolu lebati fetou napoli, rawie bofoole mei Gote nemboue amwi lefoleeke tetoo nalilu inalilufwafe lebile. Eetetie eetegeni ameefi rawie bofoo nemboue telu Israelefu retilule booreletebe.  
\ie  
\c 1  
\ms1 Naomile ritilu sekalefolee  
\mr (Rute 1)  
\s1 Elimeleke nariemutu ari kapore are Moape wokoome wane  
\p
\v 1 Bebriefe feti Israelefu inalilufwa ame yefeelu lufwalu amei lalanei tetoo nambwi lie sekaleteleefe, tefe inalilufwa metie gifefe troone troone alane. Te lufwa bofoo Judafu Betleheme wokei lalalee, te nariemutu ari kapore are Moapeme waneke te teime lamene.  
\v 2 Eetegeni lufwalu bilu Elimeleke, te nariemulu bilu Naomi, te lefoo are bilu bofoo Malone, te bofoo Kilione. Tupane Efratalu weeluane nanoo Judafu Betleheme wokei lamene. Te Moapelu inengoi waneke lamene.  
\v 3 Tetoo eeteise Elimeleke, Naomilu nunguli, tafilalee, te nembue yefee nalime lefooane are ifelatelalee.  
\v 4 Sabei nanoolu ari Moapefu\x + \xo 1:4 \xq \xt Moape \xt Oon 19:30-38.\x* inalile peenene. Te tupanelu nariemuanelu bilu bofoo Rute te bofoo Orpa. Te teime lamenei yare yarilutu yarilutu letelee.  
\v 5 Mwa, Malonetu Kilionetu mei teimeme troonalene. Tefe nembue Naomi nalime lalalee. \fig Elimeleke nariemutu ari kapore are Moapeme waneke te teime lamene. (1:1)|alt="Elimelech going to Moab" src="08_Ru_01_01_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="Sweet Publishing" ref="1:1" \fig*   
\s1 Rute Naomile tekenei lefolee  
\p
\v 6 Te Naomi teime lalali, Israelefu nale fielee, \sc Paielu\sc* wolu klomwee liele fanetelee tefe fori yesou balifule foopoolanelufe, tefe Naomi lefoo tarilu seikolu inali are mare Moapefu warife lelane.  
\v 7 Te grialeneke, Naomi seikolu inali are Judafu inengoile ifwaterife.   
\p
\v 8 Mwa, Naomi tupane inalile natelalee, “Oone boe oonanoo mianelu iteile wamoke, te mare oolalabu. Oone weife menane tukwe te tupane lufwa troonanelule tukwe nembouelu amee lepomoome. Tefe \sc Paielu\sc* mei oonane ame sameme eesalu ameele lemobe.  
\v 9 Tefe \sc Paielu\sc* nalime oonane aikopi lemobe tetoo oone weife ame lufwa boe peenemoi tetoo amwime lalabule.” Tetoo Naomi eeteise fwakee fwakee atelaleeke te nanoo mareteku metie ee napoomeneke,  
\v 10 te Naomile nafoone, “Mwa. Mene oonetu oonanoo weeluanelufile ifwapo.”   
\p
\v 11 Te Naomi natelee, “Nemboue oone weife oonanoo wokeile boe wabu. Boleboe glefe oone weife menane nifeworife? Meneboe nembue pe ari kaporele are boe luponuieke tetoo boe peenemobile? Mwa.  
\v 12 Tefe oone weife oonanoo wokeile wabu. Mene wolu inasekli lie boe glei lufwa falieke, tetoo boe ari lefe. Mwa. Eete mei nembue eesalutu boe lufwa bofoole eetegeni kriei falieke te ari luponuiei,  
\v 13 oone weife glei ooletemoomeke selime lenei peenebule. Tetoo oone weife kame eese lemoke lalabule pai? Mwa, menanoo auteli, mene metie yau tafwaile fwieke tefwee leoolaleelu atukwe menane \sc Paielu\sc* eesalu amee lewolee, tefe oone weife menane kose nifewobule mani.”   
\p
\v 14 Tetoo weife Rutetu Orpatu boe metie eeleme nefalene. Te Orpa Naomile fwafwakee ifaleeke, te Rute mwa, Naomilu amei beletameli tekeneime lefoolalee.  
\v 15 Tefe Naomi Rutele nafolee, “Bie feta, oonanoo womoo nalilu weeluanelufile, te nalilu nambuanelu gotelufile walali, te oone mei weife wabu.”  
\v 16 Mwa, Rute boe nafolee, “Oone kose mene oonane grialeworife nawole mani, te oone kose menane ble nawole mani oonetu warife. Eetegeni wokoo oone walalulu mene mei ame wafe. Te eetegeni wokoo oone lalalulu mei mene ame lalafe. Oonanoo weelu ame menanoo weelufe lebile te oonanoo Gote ame menanoo Gotefe lebe.  
\v 17 Oone tafilaluke eetei fatieworife lelanelu tekoi mei menane mei nemboue eetegeni tekoi fatiewobile. Mwa, mene oonetu weife tafilufime tetoo oone fime mene fime abile. Mene bi nelaie, nianoo nale mareteku nifeteri preme liei, \sc Paielu\sc* nanoo menane metie teieworime lebe.”  
\v 18 Naomi Rutele fetaleelu nanoo weife warife tekeneime lefoolalee, tefe na nerilu mwa.   
\s1 Naomi Rutetu boe rine  
\p
\v 19 Te weife Betlehemeile waneke, kuruwolelanei inalilufwa mareteku metie na nafwafoone. Te inali nene, “Eetekoe Naomi pai?”  
\v 20 Te Naomi natelee, “Oone menane kose Naomi\f + \fr 1:20 \fk Naomi \ft Eetegeni bilu yewilu “menengu mutukwe” atukwe.\f* nawobule mani, mwa. Kaiseklilu Same Lafwalarilu Gote menane glei amwi lemolee, tefe oone menane Mara\f + \fr 1:20 \fk Mara \ft Eetegeni bilu yewilu “tafwai tefweelu” atukwe. \f* nawobu.  
\v 21 Mene eetegeni wokoofu paie paietu waielu te nembue \sc Paielu\sc* menane reelufe iferiewolee. Mwa. Tefe boleboe glefe oone menane menengu mutukwe naoomo? Mwa. Kaiseklilu Same Lafwalarilu Gote menane na pume naoolalee, tefe metie ritilu fanewoleefe, tefe tafwai tefweelu atukwe lewolee.”   
\p
\v 22 Naomi weife Rutetu rinelu, eetegeni Moapefu lualikelu. Betlehemei barli ooloo wi lepoolanei, nembuame kreenapoolanelu lietume weife kuruwolene.   
\c 2  
\ms1 Rute balifile amee amee alarife walee  
\mr (Rute 2)  
\s1 Rute Boasele balifi fetalee  
\p
\v 1 Wolume Naomi Elimelekele falelee. Te Boase, Elimeleke mare mwamole tabe oolaielufu, nanoo yesou pumwai lalaleelu tefoo, ramelu tefoo lufwafe lelee.  
\v 2 Te Moapefu Rute Naomile nafolee, “Mene balifile wafe pe? Barli ooloo wilume letewane, te balifi amee amee alananelu pane barlile krinapoofwalanei, te mene yekuru nafwanelule plee nafwaterife walaie. Tupane lufwa menane seinaoonei, tetoo mene nifetefe.”\x + \xo 2:2 \xt Wkp 19:9-10; 23:22; Lo 24:19.\x* Te Naomi nafolee, “We, aite nemboue wa.”  
\v 3 Te Rute waleeke, tupane barli ooloole amee amee alananelu pane nambuleooneke walanei te fime walali plee nafwatelee. Rute glei rame lefolee, eetegeni bali Boaselule, Elimeleke mare mwamole tabe oolaielufu lufwa.  
\v 4 Te nembue Boase Betlehemefu nalilu balifile rieleeke, te amee amee alananelu panele natelee, “\sc Paielu\sc* nemboue oonane mare ifelamoolabe.” Te fune nafoone, “\sc Paielu\sc* nemboue oonane aikopi lewobe.”  
\v 5 Tetoo Boase nalilu balifi nambuletelaleealeelu lufwale nafolee, “Eetegeni inali ramulu boleboe akenifu?”  
\v 6 Te ekeni lufwa fune nafolee, “Eetegeni inali ramulu Moapefu, Naomitu Moape inengule grialeneke, rinelu.  
\v 7 Nali menane fiewolee, balifi amee amee alananelu panele nifeterife nawolee, tetoo fime barli kalu tomelule plee nafwaterife. Nanoo kwotue lietu amee amee lelaleeke, te itei yenepoleleeke, te boe furaleleeke amee amee wolelalee.”  
\v 8 Te Boase Rutele nafolee, “Aite, bie fie. Oone kose lufwa bofoolu balifu barli kalu tomelule plee natelaluale mani. Mwa. Oone eeteime lalalu, tetoo tupane inali ramulu mare menanoo balifi amee amee lelabu.  
\v 9 Akeni bali tupulule tupane boalelanelule fetatelu tetoo nifetewatelua. Mene lufwale wolu natie oonane glei ameefwa nalewobile. Mwa. Te oona boru fooroonalewoli, lufwa bulue bogumweetu meleele rifeneke fatinelu genile, waluke wofoe.”  
\v 10 Te Rute tumoinu krutupoleeke, rugunalelalee, keree inengoi fatieleeke te Boasele nafolee, “Mene rawie inali, glefe oone menane fetawoluke, keemakee lewolu?”  
\v 11 Te Boase fune nafolee, “Menanete wolu naoone, oonanoo suguli tafilaleeke tetoo mikelule nembouelu ameele fetou nafoomelu. Oone oonanoo miele, aiele, wokoole tukwe wogrialeteluke, te oone rawie inalilufwalufu rieluke lalalu, bebriefe oone rame leteri preme lelulu panelufi.  
\v 12 Tefe \sc Paielu\sc* oonanoo nembouelu amee wolu rame lewolee, te nali nemboue oonane sasenee yesou fune wolilule mareteku nifwawobee. Oone wolu \sc Paielufile\sc* rielu, nali Israelelu Gote, oone nalilu tukwia ambei lalalu tetoo nalimeme amwime oofulineoolabe.”  
\v 13 Te Rute Boasele fune nafolee, “Oone menane metie wolilu ameele lewolu, mene glei oonanoo amee amee inali, mwa. Oone menane kame na tafilutu nawolu. Eetegenife oone menane kame melee petilu atukwe sunanewolu.”  
\v 14 Te fori yesou fooporife yenalelanei, te Boase Rutele nafolee, “Oone eeteme rie, te tabe bofoo faleluke, wainei pieleluke, te foe.” Tefe Rute tupane inalilufwalu bwagei mare laprueleneke lalanei, te Boase telu barli ooloo i frulule nifwalee. Rute fopoleeke yelu lefoleefe te telu lualee.  
\v 15 Te Rute wolu furaleleeke barli kalu tome boe plee nafwaterife lelali, tetoo Boase balifi amee amee alananelu panele natelee, “Eke bulupoofwamoke luamolufi ekeise nemboue plee natelabee, tetoo kose ble nafobule mani, mwa.  
\v 16 Ekeni mei, bulupoolamolu kalu tome telule gliapomoke teime grialetebu tetoo plee naferietebe. Oone kose ble nafobule mani, mwa.” \fig Te Rute waleeke, tupane barli ooloole amee amee alananelu pane nambuleooneke walanei te fime walali plee nafwatelee. (2:3)|alt="Ruth gleaning" src="08_Ru_02_01_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="Sweet Publishing" ref="2:3" \fig*   
\p
\v 17 Te Rute teime eetegeni balifime barli kalu tomelule plee naferieteleeke te lie wolu ambei yetemelee. Tetoo kalu tome katu tainepoofwaleeke, barli ooloole yekuru nenelu genile plee nateleeke, eetegeni barli ooloo ritilu 10 kg atukwe lelee.  
\v 18 Rute buluele arueleeke, wokeile tewalee. Te yefeekelu Rute terielaleefe fetalalee. Te telu liei fopoleeke yelu lefoleefe lualeelu eetele faleleeke yefeekelule fanelee.  
\v 19 Tefe Naomi Rutele nafolee, “Ooneboe nembue barli ooloo glefuleme plee natelu? Inelu balifule? Te \sc Paielu\sc* eetegeni lufwa oonane aikopi lewoleelule nemboue aikopi lefoolabe.” Te Rute Naomile fune nafolee, “Menekoe Boase nafoonelu lufwalu balifi amieke rie.”  
\v 20 Te Naomi lualile nafolee, “\sc Paielu\sc* Boasele nemboue aikopi lefoolabe, inepane oofulilu lalanelu, te inepane troonalenelu mei menengu ruforitu letelaleealee.” Te boe nafolee, “Ekeni lufwa nanookoe mwamole tabe oolaielufu, tefe ilekuli groo lerife lelaleelu lufwa.”\x + \xo 2:20 \xt Wkp 25:25.\x*  
\v 21 Te Rute Naomile nafolee, “Boase menane na bofoo nawolee, ‘Oone menanoo balifi amee amee alananelu pane mare alabu, barlitu witetu tatukweme plee nafwatemoke te soonaletebu.’ ”  
\v 22 Te Naomi Rutele nafolee, “Aite, nemboue oone Boaselu balifi amee amee alananelu inali mare alabu. Kose oonane bofoo lufwalu balifi teiewobile.”  
\v 23 Tefe Rute nanoolu inali ramulule nifetewatelee, barli ooloole, wite ooloole Boaselu balifuleme afwatelaneime wolu soonaletene. Te Rute ame yefeekelutu lalane. \fig Kosi nalutu witele kreenapoolane.|alt="harvesting wheat (collage)" src="LB00098B.TIF" size="col" copy="Louise Bass" ref="2:23" \fig*\fig Wite wolu wi lelanei bokekwaeeyelu lepoolane.|alt="ripe heads of wheat (collage)" src="HK00099B.TIF" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="2:23" \fig* \fig Witele bulupooneke te lie afoi tufurenune tetoo falu leporife.|alt="sheaves of wheat to dry (collage)" src="HK00100B.TIF" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="2:23" \fig* \fig Bulmakau wite buluferilu pumwai ifwari ifatelali atulepoofwanane.|alt="press wheat to remove wheat kernels (collage)" src="HK00096B.TIF" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="2:23" \fig* \fig Wite oolu riti lepoonelufe tefe boe inengoi yekurunene.|alt="winnowing wheat (collage)" src="HK00097B.TIF" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="2:23" \fig*   
\c 3  
\ms1 Boase Rutele wolilu ameele lefolee  
\mr (Rute 3)  
\s1 Naomi Rutele falerife lufwale ooratefoolalee  
\p
\v 1 Naomi lualikelu Rutele nafolee, “Aitea, niame ame lufwa woliluleme amwi oorafwieke, tetoo oone falele pe? Oonanoo lafierilu tetoo amwi feti lewobe.  
\v 2 Eetegeni lufwa Boase, ute oona nalilu balifi inali mare amee amee afoomoomelu, nanookoe menanoo mwamole oolaielufu. Fie, nembue kriei barli ooloo yekuru nelanei atelanelu tekoi amee amee wolerife lelalee.  
\v 3 Tefe melee rofoluke te nemboue seralule reefi buleteluke, te wamolulu leeloole sineluke, tetoo amee amee alarilu tekoile tirale. Oone kose oo lebati lefole mani, kose fetawobe. Tefe kame fetalalu, bie kakali lelee waine folee lebee.  
\v 4 Te eetei luerife lelaleelu reeafweele amwime fetala. Tetoo pitukoeme waluke, nalilu bebeti leeloo soulu kulika porite kuraleluke, te kulikai lue. Te sabei nali ame oonane na nawobe.”  
\v 5 Te Rute fune nafolee, “Nemboue eke nafwawolulu na mene ame nifefe.”   
\p
\v 6 Te Rute barli ooloo yekuru nelanei atelananelu tekoile tiralelee, Naomilu naleme nifelee.  
\v 7 Te Boase wolu fori yesou foleeke, nanoolu menengu mutukwe lefoleeke, te rofoo lefoleefe waleeke, barli ooloo lukuletelanelu bwagei lulalee. Te Rute lulali fetaleefe, te pitukoememe waleeke, bebeti leeloo soulu kulika poritefule kuralefoleeke, tetoo Boaselu kulika porite luelee.  
\v 8 Krie keekee lelali te Boase betige lelee tetoo moporite ambure leleelu, mwa, inalileme nalilu kulika bwagei lulali oorinalefolee!  
\v 9 Te fiefolee, “Ooneboe ine?” Te Rute fune nafolee, “Mene Rute, mene oonafe amee amee aoolaielu inali. Oone Elimeleke mare mwamole tabe oolaielufu, tefe ilekuli groolerife rie, oone menane amwi amwi leoolarife.”\x + \xo 3:9 \xt Rut 3:4.\x*   
\p
\v 10 Te Boase nafolee, “Aite, \sc Paielu\sc* oonane amwime lewobee. Oonekoe mwanga, eetegeni amee wolilu oone menane lewolulu, ekeni amee mikelule lefoomelule genile boore lefolu. Te ari rawielu motukwe lapruefwalanei, te telu yesou kalu babifu, te telu mwa, oone glei menengu letelu ekepane faleworife.  
\v 11 Tefe oone kose wofri lele mani, mwa. Menanoo fwi wokoofu inalilufwa mareteku wolu rame leoone, oonanoo wolilu ameele fetanelufe. Tefe mene ame letefe, yesou mareteku oone menane natewolulule.  
\v 12 Ekeni na nelulu marena, mene oonanoo lufwatu weife mwamole tabe oolaielufu, tefe mene oonane ame amwi amwi leoolafe. Mwa. Ilekuli groolerife lelaleelu lufwa bofoo ame lalalee, mene nanoole taufofwielu.  
\v 13 Te bie nembue eetegeni krie oone teime lue, te kwotue mene ame waieke ekeni lufwalu menengule wofalefofe. Nali mwamole tabe neleeke i neli, eetete nemboue lebe. Nali ulabee neli, tetoo nia ame ilekuli groo lefe. \sc Paielu\sc* wolu rame lelalee mene glei kosefe nawofe, mwa. Sei, oone boe lue.”   
\p
\v 14 Te Rute Boaselu kulika porite lulaleeke, te kwotue krieime ame pinanelali furalelee. Te Boase nafolee, “Kose oonane inalilufwa eetegeni tekoofu walalu rame lewobile.”  
\v 15 Te Boase nafolee, “Oonanoo bebeti leeloo terieluke guelufi bebenetalalu amee gigi naletela.” Te Rute gigi netalali, te Boase barli ooloo fine fine atefoleelu bogumwee tialootu lelee. Eetegeni ritilu 20 kg atukwe lelee. Te Boase boletafoleeke tetoo arueleeke, te wokeile walee.  
\v 16 Te Rute itei woseka leleeke, te yefeekelu fiefolee, “Sei, aite, akeke lewolee?” Tetoo Rute yefeekelule Boase amee amee lefoleelule na ulufi letewafolee.  
\v 17 “Eetegeni barli ooloo bogumwee tialootu lewolee, menane fanewoleeke te nawolee, ‘Oone glei preme mikelufile wale.’ ”   
\p
\v 18 Te yefeekelu nafolee, “Aitea, bie oolefoolalu futeni fipwalefoola yesou gleleme lebe, Boase glei preme lalabe. Mwa. Eetegeni amee lerife neleelu bie nembuememe seree lebee.”   
\c 4  
\ms1 \sc Paielu\sc* Naomile amwi aikopi lefobe  
\mr (Rute 4)  
\s1 Boase Malonelu ilekulile groo lelee  
\p
\v 1 Te Boase wokoo geeneri ambleneile\f + \fr 4:1 \fk wokoo geeneri ambleneile \ft Eete tupanelu lukulenanelu tekoo.\f* bulaleeke, lafieleeke lalalee. Te ilekuli groo lerilu lufwa bofoo sekaterieleefe fetaleeke, te eetegeni lufwale fieri nafolee, “Ei! Oone bie rieluke eetei lafie, mene oonane na tukweelule naworife lelaie.” Te weife lapruelene.  
\v 2 Te Boase eetegeni wokoofu yefeelu lufwaleme yarilutu yarilutu mei nateleeke, te rineke laprune.  
\v 3 Te ekeni ilekuli groo lerilu bofoole nafolee, “Naomi wolu wokoo Moapele wogrialeleeke rielee. Naomi nunguli Elimelekelu inengule bwaleefile faneterife lelalee. Elimeleke mena mare mwamole tabe oolaielu lufwa.  
\v 4 Eetegenife mene oonane fieoolaie, oona menengu akeke lelu tetoo oone nanoolu inengule fale, nembue menanoo wokoofu yefeelu lufwa telu mare lapruelelanei fetaoolanelu oofi falefe nelu o, oona ulabee nelu, tetoo menane nawo. Lufwa bofoo glei lalanei, te niame oonane taufowielu lufwa.” Te eetegeni lufwa Boasele nafolee, “We, mene ame bwaleefile fanetefe.”   
\p
\v 5 Te Boase nafolee, “Oone eetegeni inengu Naomilu amee fanetefe nelulu, eetete tafilaleelu lufwalu seikolu inali, Moapefu Rutele mei falele, te eetegeni inengu tetoo eetegeni lufwa tafilaleelu bilufe same lafoolarife, nali mare mwamole tabe oolaielu lufwa falenei.”   
\p
\v 6 Eetegenife tefe Boasele nafolee, “Marena nia metie mwa, glei eetegeni ameele lefe. Kose neembee nianoo arilu yesou boe glei ekeni inalilu arile yesoule nifwafe, tefe nembue oonameme fale. Mene oonane seinaoolaie.”   
\p
\v 7 (Te bebriefeme, Israelefu lufwa bofoo, lufwa bofoole na amwime neneke, tetoo yesou falerife o yesou fune fune arife te eesalu amee lenane. Kuli leeloole ligaleleeke, lufwa bofoole fanelee, tetoo rame leneke alarife.)\x + \xo 4:7 \xt Lo 25:9.\x*   
\p
\v 8 Tefe eetegeni lufwa Boasele nafolee, “Oonameme eetegeni inengule fale.” Te esulu kuli leeloo ligaleleeke, te Boasele fanelee.  
\v 9 Te Boase yefeelu panele tukwe inalilufwa mare lalanelule tukwe natelee, “Oone wolu fetamoke rame lelamo. Naomi nunguli Elimelekelu yesoule tukwe lefoo are Kilionelu Malonelu yesoule tukwe mareteku ifelatemeleelule nia nembue wolu peenie.  
\v 10 Mene nembue Moapefu Rutele mei wolu falie, Malonelu seikolule. Mene Rutele falielufe, tefe Malonelu inengu nalilufeme latelarife lelaie. Tefe eetegeni lufwa tafilaleelu bilutu, retifu pane Malonelu bilu glei menengu futi nebile, fwi wokoo mei same glei menengu futi nebile. Nembue oone mareteku lalamoi filamo.”\x + \xo 4:10 \xt Lo 25:5-6.\x*   
\p
\v 11 Te yefeelu lufwa, inalilufwa mare lukulenelu tekoi lalanei na fune, “We, marena mene mareteku oonanoo na fineke rame leoone. Te \sc Paielu\sc* nanoole amwi aikopi lefobe, ekeni inali nembue oonanoo iteile rierife lelaleelule Reseletu, Leatu lenelu atukwe, te weife mena Israelelufe lene. Te oona mei Efratalu weelufu paie tefoo lufwafe lele tetoo Betlehemei oonanoo soulu bilu laoolabe.\x + \xo 4:11 \xt Oon 29:31.\x*  
\v 12 Te \sc Paielu\sc* ame oonane weife inalitu ari motukwe nifwamobe tetoo wee wee afwaneke, Pereselu weelu atukwe, Pereselu yari Juda, yefee Tamare.”\x + \xo 4:12 \xt Oon 38:27-30.\x*   
\s1 Boase Rutele falelee  
\p
\v 13 Te Boase Rutele faleleeke, te ifeluelee. Te \sc Paielu\sc* Rutele aikopi lefoleefe tefe arietu leleeke, te ari kaporele lupolelee.  
\v 14 Te inali Naomile nafoone, “Mene \sc Paielule\sc* paie paie afoolane, nembue oonane ilekuli grooleri lufwale fanewolee,\x + \xo 4:14 \xt Rut 1:21.\x* nali eetegeni ari Rute nembue lupoleleelu, tetoo nanoolu bilu Israelei wee wee afwabe.  
\v 15 Te ooneboe ree fue nalewoleeke, te oonane yelune lewoleeke lalalu te amwime oofulineoolabe. Oonanoo wolualikelu oonane nafieoolaleealeelu, nembue ari wolu lupolelee. Te nali oonane gifeworife lelaleelu, kapore ari tialoo mwamole gifeworife lenelule boore letelee.”  
\v 16 Te Naomi naooele paflitalali gifelalee.  
\v 17 Te mwamole tikliafofu inali nafoone, “Naomi wolu kapore ari naooefe lefoleeke lalalee, lualikelu Rute lupoleleelu arile.” Te eetegeni ari bilu fanenelu Obete nafoone. Te sabei Obete Jesilu yarife lelee, te Jesi Devitelu yarife lelee.   
\s1 Kin Devitelu weelufi  
\p
\v 18 Te Pereselu weelufu Pereselufi leleeke letewaleeke Devitelufi sekaleleelu, eese lelee: Perese Hesronelu yari,  
\v 19 te Hesrone Ramelu yari, te Rame Aminadapelu yari,  
\v 20 te Aminadape Nasonelu yari, te Nasone Salmonelu yari,  
\v 21 te Salmone Boaselu yari, te Boase Obetelu yari,  
\v 22 te Obete Jesilu yari, te Jesi Devitelu yari.\f + \fr 4:22 \ft Te sabei Devite Israelelu kine lufwafe lelee (1 Sml 16:1-13).\f*   